goldens/language/slot/local/a_multi_line_string_a_bare_local_takes_keeps_its_lines.ns -text
# A golden that prints a module text its string literal spans several lines
# of: keep its line feeds as committed on every platform.
goldens/library/mirror-builder/a_module_is_declared_from_source.ns -text
